<title>LEBANON: SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT JORDAN 1-0 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT JORDAN 1-0 IN FRIENDLY INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon beat Jordan 1-0 (halftime</p>
<p>1-0) in a friendly soccer international on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Jamal Taha 12</p>
<p>The teams will play a return match in Amman next Friday.</p>
